# Monitor_sys operational rules

- All code changes are made in the **local** working copy only.
- **Do not commit** unless the user explicitly asks. Commits are manual.
- **Do not deploy** unless the user explicitly asks. Deploy is manual.
- Production servers (**MY107**, **MYOR**) are **read-only** by default: inspect/status only.
- Write/change anything on prod (keys, files, packages, containers, firewall) only when the user explicitly requests it.
- Server names in the bot UI: `MY107`, `MYOR`.
